[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5283.11, "timestamp": "01:28:03", "text": "踢。它被自己的人射杀了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5285.11, "timestamp": "01:28:05", "text": "队友。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5287.83, "timestamp": "01:28:07", "text": "是的，哦，我喜欢他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5294.07, "timestamp": "01:28:14", "text": "就是这样。那件事一定会发生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5304.629, "timestamp": "01:28:24", "text": "哦，他们改进了助行器。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5308.55, "timestamp": "01:28:28", "text": "现在这台电脑简直就是一台8080了。是的。有人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5312.79, "timestamp": "01:28:32", "text": "死？好的。是的。我当时没注意，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5322.229, "timestamp": "01:28:42", "text": "射击。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5331.43, "timestamp": "01:28:51", "text": "这是什么东西？这是什么迷你版？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5333.75, "timestamp": "01:28:53", "text": "工厂？糟糕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5335.99, "timestamp": "01:28:55", "text": "我走路的时候应该环顾四周。我"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5336.808, "timestamp": "01:28:56", "author": "@site36.official", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Oc0kgq4lSUaD-BoDbaDE3pXUquuz47c4Yh7kwPILHO2D70EQ5EnEgoGgTbb5gw993EEXRqCx_A=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I'm not going to lie, the lag and rendering is insanely low on the game."}]